{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/31978-chronicle-idea-what-if-almost-half-the-world-replaced-with-fetches","id":31978,"title":"Chronicle Idea: What if almost half the World replaced with Fetches?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-17T16:25:34-08:00","id":31978,"title":"Chronicle Idea: What if almost half the World replaced with Fetches?","content":"This was a chronicle idea I had for a while, particularly I think about it each time I see this one movie, I forgot what it was called but it was about a woman who discovers that the reflections in the mirror are starting to come into the real world, kill their counterparts, and start to help other reflections replace neighbors and family. It got me thinking what if out of the blue the Gentry en masse just abducted a vaaaast amount of the Worlds population, perhaps even as large as 1/3rd or even 1/2. Hey maybe you could do 2012 apocalypse style to represent that the prophecy was actually just the awareness of the end of an ancient pact with the Fae and humanity. After the pact is Over all of Faery fill their coffers with human chattel. Now all of a sudden the World has a vaaast amount of Fetches, do they want to take over? Do they all have a plan or is it like with the default setting where some fetches are not even aware of who they are? Does the World start do discover something very strange has happened to the Entire World? And now a huge population boom as Vaaaaaast amounts of Changelings make it back to the as Arcadia practically overflows with all the Gentries new Pet/Slaves and many are able to return. So now the world essentially changes over night, Most everyone knows their closest friends and family are acting different, and overpopulation of becomes an issue, probably forcing Changelings to en masse create Hollows to support their teeming communities so they can figure out how to take back the world. Now the Changeling Population swells from previously in say the thousands, to the millions or even Billions! And with the Drastic shift the other Supernatural communities are crippled, Vampires get ghouls and servants returned unbound and different, perhaps the fetches take up the opportunity to pogram the Kindred, and Genocide Pure and Foresaken alike.<br /> <br /> The World is so different, and now what do your players do? Before the Courts aped the Kingdoms of man in a microcosm, but now their populations now actually mean a Kings are actual Kings of Kingdoms, they have Armies and Cities. What do you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T17:51:46-08:00","id":32031,"title":"","content":"Most changelings, if they can identify them, would kill fetches.<br /> <br /> I haven't run changeling, but I'm playing it. My character couldn't do anything about massive world overpopulation, he's also pretty self-centered so he likely wouldn't do anything about it beyond how it affected his life. He's pretty much a pacifist, but if some mortal friends of his were replaced and came back as changelings he'd probably help them find their fetches, looking the other way when they kill or absorb them. The other members of the motley would probably go out hunting and killing, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T06:29:30-08:00","id":32342,"title":"","content":"There's a more subtle long-term consequence I can think of: Fetches are sterile, barring exceptional circumstances (like true love for the other parent, and even then most mothers die during childbirth, human or Fetch). When they're not, they produce either human children who are special enough to attract the attention of fae creatures, or horrible little psychopaths that can't be locked down.<br /> Within a few decades, you're therefore going to see a huge drop in the world population, and a non-negligible proportion of kids who will be born are going to have a big influence on fae matters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T06:46:44-08:00","id":32355,"title":"","content":"Oh are Fetches Sterile? I forgot the Rules on that, I did know Changelings where sterile, usually, so I figured just with that the world would have this huge amount of people that can't breed, meanwhile suffering from overpopulation. Introducing so many barren individuals to the breeding pool would insanely devastate the world population as its not immediately apparent who is sterile to most folks. That could mean that after a generation or so the population could drop from close to 10 Billion to less then a billion.<br /> <br /> Also worth noting even if the Fetches are ignorant of being Fetches you know have soooo many of the World Population that can see the Mien of Changelings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T07:10:28-08:00","id":32369,"title":"","content":"Yep, it's not an obvious or immediate problem, but it's a big one. And I double-checked; Fetches can only be parent not only if they truly love their partner AND ignore they're Fetches. So that's not going to be a lot of people.<br /> Therefore, even if peace is made somehow between Fetches, Changelings, and however few mundane humans left... the world is going to be in an awful need of the Goblin Fruit (or was it a Goblin Contract? Can't remember) that allows reproduction even between sterile parents (but at the cost of having a kid that's weird in some way and is likely to hate you).<br /> Of course, all of that is moot if Changelings and Fetches slaughter each other first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T07:15:28-08:00","id":32370,"title":"","content":"Well there would be so many Fetches that the genocide needed to even scratch their population numbers would drive changelings insane with clarity loss, or really anyone insane as Fetches are pretty near human as far as most others that notice they are different at all.<br /> <br /> Its very likely the big secret gets revealed pretty early. The World would likely change drastically no matter the outcome.<br /> <br /> But this could result in the trend of families that find out they can have children being encouraged to have as many children as they can.<br /> <br /> And with so many of the human population made into Fetches/Changelings that means you have a lot Changelings that were individuals in positions of power like Generals, and even Presidents, Queens, and Billionaires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}